<title>USA: Union Planters, Leader merger OK'd.</title>
<headline>Union Planters, Leader merger OK'd.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Planters Corp and Leader Financial Corp said Friday that shareholders of both companies have approved their merger.</p>
<p>Under the deal, which is expected to close in early October, Union Planters will acquire Leader Financial in a deal valued at about $523 million.</p>
<p>Investors of Leader Financial are to receive 1.525 shares of Union Planters common stock for each share of Leader stock. Any fractional shares are to be paid in cash.</p>
</text>
